# Demo trace for configs/tiny.toml  (0 = read, 1 = write, 2 = instruction fetch)
# L1: 128 B, 16 B blocks, 2-way -> 4 sets.  L2: 512 B, 4-way.
# 0x10000000, 0x10000040 and 0x10000080 all map to the same L1 set.
